Package: tcmnetpharma
Type: Package
Title: Network Pharmacology Analysis Toolkit for Traditional Chinese Medicine
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "JianXiao",
           family = "Zheng",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "zhengjianxiao@tjutcm.edu.cn",
           comment = c(affiliation = "Haihe Laboratory of Modern Chinese Medicine, Tianjin University of Traditional Chinese Medicine"))
Description: A visualization tool for network pharmacology data analysis, powered by an
    integrated multi-source database. Distributed resources are TCMSP, HERB 2.0,
    BATMAN-TCM 2.0, ETCM2, ChEMBL 37, STRING 12, TRRUST v2, Open Targets Platform and
    SymMap V2, plus offline gene sets from WikiPathways, Reactome and Gene Ontology.
    TTD (all rights reserved) and KEGG (proprietary) are not redistributed. See
    inst/extdata/DATA-README.md for versioning, licensing and attribution requirements.
